    {
      "Original": "When this setting is enabled the Camera Tilt will be set to a value in-between the \"Enabled\" and \"Disabled\" values based on the camera's distance from your character.\nTriggers and Smoothing will have no effect while this setting is enabled.",
      "Translated": "启用此设置后，相机倾斜将根据相机与角色的距离，设置为 “已启用” 和 “已禁用” 值之间的值。\n当此设置处于启用状态时，触发器和平滑操作将不会产生任何效果。",
      "Context": "TiltedUI.DrawTiltAngleSection",
      "Source": "library"
